1. Combat Animations [IN_PROGRESS]
   - Attack Sequences
     - Speed-synced timing (see @sub-battle-animation-timing.mdc)
     - Impact effects with spring physics
     - Multi-hit coordination
   - Damage Visualization
     - Number popups with 1s fade
     - Scale/fade combinations
     - Multiple hit staggering
   - Health System
     - Color interpolation at 60fps
     - Smooth value transitions
     - Rapid update buffering
   - Status Effects
     - Composable overlay system
     - Z-index management
     - Multiple effect handling

2. Movement System [IN_PROGRESS]
   - Position Updates
     - Matrix transform usage
     - Path following logic
     - Network line constraints
   - Path Preview
     - State-based transitions
     - Valid/invalid indication
     - Real-time updates
   - Range Indicators
     - Efficient circle scaling
     - Real-time updates
     - Clear boundary display
   - Network Visualization
     - Bezier curve transitions
     - Direction indicators
     - Connection state feedback

